  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together peanut butter, coconut milk, fish sauce (if using), lime juice, brown sugar, ginger, and garlic.",
    "Thread beef slices onto charred argentinian beef skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush skewers with vegetable oil and season with coriander.",
    "Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until beef is cooked to desired level of doneness.",
    "Serve immediately with peanut sauce for dipping."
